        "original_id": "c079335c-776b-5dd2-936d-a58d9a687de4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willie Geist, Bryant Gumbel, Jane Pauley, Deborah Norville, Katie Couric, Matt Lauer, Savannah Guthrie\n- TV Shows: Way Too Early, Today, PM Magazine\n- Roles: host, fill-in anchor, TV journalist\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1980s, PM Magazine was hosted by TV journalists including Jane Pauley, Deborah Norville, Katie Couric, and Matt Lauer.\n- Today has had hosts including Bryant Gumbel, Jane Pauley, Deborah Norville, Katie Couric, Matt Lauer, and Savannah Guthrie.\n- Willie Geist is the host of Way Too Early.\n- Willie Geist frequently serves as a fill-in anchor on Today.\n- The TV journalist on Today for whom Willie Geist frequently fills in is Savannah Guthrie.",
